cybersecurity right

00:19:59.340 --> 00:20:03.120
now that just scream for the
need for machine learning.

00:20:03.120 --> 00:20:05.770
First of all, the
growth of malware.

00:20:05.770 --> 00:20:08.580
So there's a massive amount
