signatures for those threats.

00:20:17.560 --> 00:20:20.780
Second of all, the growth
of overall devices.

00:20:20.780 --> 00:20:23.980
There will be 50 billion
connected devices

00:20:23.980 --> 00:20:27.190
on public and private
networks by the year 2020,

00:20:27.190 --> 00:20:29.080
