00:21:11.130 --> 00:21:15.350
- DeepArmor solves the problem
of detecting malware using

00:21:15.350 --> 00:21:18.450
machine learning techniques
by effectively building

00:21:18.450 --> 00:21:20.450
a set of machine
learning classifiers

00:21:20.450 --> 00:21:24.610
